CM_ BO_ 400 "Signals replaced 2026-08-03 based on can_io.c firmware (case 0x190, SAM_Motor_controller RX handler): byte0=enabled, byte1=powerModuleError, byte2=hardwareError, byte3=driveError, byte4=driveWarning. Original DBC guess (constant_f4/constant_01/always_00_01_02) did not match the firmware and has been discarded.";
